   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A repeated habit",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something was done often, as a habit, use **-곤 하다**: 가다 → **가곤 했어요** (used to go), 먹다 → **먹곤 했어요** (used to eat), 전화하다 → **전화하곤 했어요** (used to call).",
      "할머니 집에 자주 **가곤 했어요** = I used to go to my grandmother's house often."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Present",
     "texto": [
      "If it is a habit you have now, use **-곤 해요**: 자주 **먹곤 해요** = I tend to eat often.",
      "It is different from **-아/어요** (general): **-곤 해요** tells that something happens regularly."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
